# 🚀 Email Outreach → CRM Module Integration

## Tổng quan kiến trúc hiện tại

Sau khi phân tích repo [tdgames_billing](https://github.com/tdgamesvn/tdgames_billing):

```
tdgames_billing/
├── App.tsx                     # Main router, module switching
├── config/apps.ts              # App registry (10 modules)
├── types.ts                    # All TypeScript interfaces
├── services/supabaseClient.ts  # Supabase connection
├── apps/
│   ├── crm/                    # 🎯 TARGET MODULE
│   │   ├── components/
│   │   │   ├── CrmApp.tsx      # Main CRM with tab navigation
│   │   │   ├── ClientList.tsx  # Client table
│   │   │   ├── ClientForm.tsx  # Client CRUD
│   │   │   ├── ActivityTimeline.tsx
│   │   │   ├── DocumentList.tsx
│   │   │   ├── PaymentTracker.tsx
│   │   │   └── ProjectList.tsx
│   │   ├── hooks/useCrmState.ts
│   │   └── services/crmService.ts  # Supabase CRUD
│   ├── invoice/                # Has EmailModal.tsx (reference)
│   ├── hr/, payroll/, expense/, ...
```

**Key facts:**
- **Frontend-only SPA** (Vite + React + TypeScript)
- **No backend server** — trực tiếp gọi Supabase từ client
- **Supabase** = database + auth
- **CRM đã có**: `CrmClient` (status: lead→contacted→active), `CrmContact`, `CrmActivity`
- Deploy: `app.tdgamestudio.com` (static build on VPS nginx)

---

## Vấn đề kiến trúc

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Email sending cần server-side** — Gmail API dùng OAuth2 token, không thể chạy từ browser SPA.
> Cần một **backend microservice** trên VPS để handle email gửi.

### Giải pháp: Hybrid Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│           app.tdgamestudio.com (SPA)            │
│     CRM Module → Outreach Tab (React UI)        │
│                    │                             │
│     ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐             │
│     ▼              ▼              ▼             │
│  Supabase       FastAPI Email   Supabase        │
│  (read/write    Microservice    (read/write     │
│   leads data)   (send emails)    email logs)    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

VPS Megahost_02:
  ├── Nginx → app.tdgamestudio.com (static SPA)
  └── FastAPI → localhost:8401 (email API)
       └── Gmail OAuth token
       └── Rate limiting
       └── Template rendering
```

---

## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Database Schema (Supabase)

#### [NEW] Supabase Tables

**`crm_outreach_leads`** — Leads từ enriched CSV (link tới `crm_clients`)

```sql
CREATE TABLE crm_outreach_leads (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    -- Link to CRM client (optional, for converted leads)
    client_id UUID REFERENCES crm_clients(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,
    -- Lead info
    studio_name TEXT NOT NULL,
    contact_name TEXT NOT NULL,
    first_name TEXT,
    email TEXT NOT NULL,
    job_title TEXT,
    linkedin_url TEXT,
    -- Tier ranking
    tier INTEGER DEFAULT 3,  -- 1=Art Director, 2=Producer, 3=CEO
    -- Outreach status
    outreach_status TEXT DEFAULT 'pending',
    -- pending | initial_sent | followup1_sent | followup2_sent | replied | bounced | unsubscribed
    initial_sent_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    followup1_sent_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    followup2_sent_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    replied_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    -- Meta
    source TEXT DEFAULT 'salesql',    -- salesql | manual | website
    tags TEXT[] DEFAULT '{}',
    notes TEXT DEFAULT '',
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);
```

**`crm_email_log`** — Log mỗi email đã gửi

```sql
CREATE TABLE crm_email_log (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    lead_id UUID REFERENCES crm_outreach_leads(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    template_name TEXT NOT NULL,       -- initial_outreach | followup_1 | followup_2
    to_email TEXT NOT NULL,
    subject TEXT NOT NULL,
    gmail_message_id TEXT,
    status TEXT DEFAULT 'sent',        -- sent | bounced | failed
    error_message TEXT,
    sent_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);
```

**`crm_email_templates`** — Templates (optional, cho template editor)

```sql
CREATE TABLE crm_email_templates (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    name TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    subject_template TEXT NOT NULL,
    html_content TEXT NOT NULL,
    is_active BOOLEAN DEFAULT true,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);
```

---

### Phase 2: Email Microservice (VPS)

#### [NEW] `/opt/td-mailer-api/` — FastAPI Email Service

Lightweight Python API xử lý email sending, reuse code từ `cold_email_sender.py`.

```
/opt/td-mailer-api/
├── main.py              # FastAPI app
├── requirements.txt     # fastapi, uvicorn, google-api-python-client
├── services/
│   ├── gmail_sender.py  # Gmail API logic (from cold_email_sender.py)
│   └── template_renderer.py  # Load + personalize templates
├── templates/           # HTML email templates
│   ├── initial_outreach.html
│   ├── followup_1.html
│   └── followup_2.html
├── credentials/
│   └── gmail_token.json # OAuth token
└── td-mailer-api.service  # systemd
```

**API Endpoints:**

| Method | Endpoint | Mô tả |
|--------|----------|--------|
| POST | `/api/email/send` | Gửi email cho 1 lead |
| POST | `/api/email/batch` | Gửi batch (with rate limiting) |
| POST | `/api/email/test` | Gửi test email |
| GET | `/api/email/status` | Sending quota status today |
| POST | `/api/email/preview` | Render template preview |
| POST | `/api/inbox/scan` | Check replies & bounces |

**Security:** API key in header (`X-API-Key: <secret>`) — chỉ SPA mới biết key.

**Nginx config** (thêm vào `app.tdgamestudio.com`):
```nginx
location /api/email/ {
    proxy_pass http://localhost:8401/api/email/;
}
```

→ Frontend gọi `https://app.tdgamestudio.com/api/email/send` → nginx proxy → FastAPI.

